<title>JAPAN: Nintendo advances in morning session.</title>
<headline>Nintendo advances in morning session.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nintendo Co Ltd shares advanced in Wednesday morning trade, pushed by foreign investor buying interest on the Osaka bourse, brokers said.</p>
<p>At midday, the shares were 10 yen higher at 8,110 yen.</p>
<p>&quot;In Tokyo, blue-chip shares of Honda Motor Co Ltd, Toyota Motor Corp are at the centre of trade, but in Osaka, Nintendo is in the spotlight,&quot; a second-tier broker said.</p>
</text>
